Measured on import: 41 joints, 3716 vertices, 4148 triangles, 76 clips
(Idle, Walking_A/B/C, Running_A/B, Jump_*, Sit_Chair_*, 1H_Melee_*, Block,
Hit, Death, Spellcast, ...). All 15 rig bones bind by name.

RiggedFigure.gltf / RiggedFigure.dfo   — THE MINIMAL READER FIXTURE
--------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:  Khronos Group, glTF-Sample-Assets
         https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Assets
         Models/RiggedFigure/glTF-Embedded/RiggedFigure.gltf
Licence: © 2017 Cesium — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
